src/client.ts adapts the upstream class-based HTTP request flow, URLSearchParams
encoding, X-API-KEY/Accept/Content-Type headers, JSON body handling, timeout
pattern and HTTP 204 handling. The connector architecture is used without an
MCP process. Mutations/methods and official routes are extended from the pinned
official specifications. Base-URL/global configuration, GET-only connector,
automatic retry and raw error-body exposure have been replaced.

Official API specifications are public Ubiquiti documentation, downloaded from:
  https://developer.ui.com/site-manager/v1.0.0/openapi.json
  https://developer.ui.com/network/v10.6.106/openapi.json
